---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
const cards=[
{icon:'♧',title:'Fire & Life Safety',text:'Fire alarm, hydrant, sprinkler, pump and maintenance services for safer facilities.',href:'/services/',link:'Explore services'},
{icon:'◉',title:'Smart Monitoring',text:'Connect selected alarm and equipment signals to a notification workflow, subject to site requirements.',href:'/smart-monitoring/',link:'Explore monitoring'},
{icon:'⌁',title:'Building Systems Integration',text:'Coordinate fire safety with pressurization, ventilation and selected building equipment controls.',href:'/services/building-systems-integration/',link:'Explore integration'},
{icon:'▦',title:'Security & ELV',text:'CCTV, access control and networking solutions planned around your facility.',href:'/services/security-elv/',link:'Explore security & ELV'},
{icon:'⟳',title:'Planned Maintenance',text:'Structured inspections, service reports and maintenance support for installed systems.',href:'/services/fire-safety-amc/',link:'Explore AMC'},
{icon:'⌂',title:'Site Assessment',text:'Identify practical repair, integration and upgrade paths before deciding what to replace.',href:'/contact/',link:'Request a survey'}];
---
<MainLayout>
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Fire & Safety · Integration · Smart Monitoring</div><h1>From fire safety systems to <span>smart, connected buildings.</span></h1><p class="lead">InteGrowSys helps facilities maintain essential safety systems, integrate building equipment and explore smarter monitoring—without assuming every legacy system needs a complete replacement.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Make My Existing System Smart ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/services/">Explore our services</a></div><p class="micro-note">Site-specific design · Integration-led thinking · Practical maintenance support</p></div><div class="hero-visual"><div class="visual-label">Connected facility concept</div><div class="visual-title">Know what’s happening across your systems.</div><div class="status-stack"><div class="status-row"><span><i class="status-dot"></i>Fire alarm interface</span><strong>Signal</strong></div><div class="status-row"><span><i class="status-dot"></i>Equipment status</span><strong>Monitor</strong></div><div class="status-row"><span><i class="status-dot"></i>Remote notification</span><strong>Respond</strong></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div class="eyebrow">What we do</div><h2>Safety systems that work. Information that helps you act.</h2><p>From planned maintenance to carefully scoped monitoring upgrades, we focus on making systems useful to the people responsible for facilities, safety and operations.</p></div><div class="card-grid">{cards.map(c=><article class="card"><div class="icon-box" aria-hidden="true">{c.icon}</div><h3>{c.title}</h3><p>{c.text}</p><a class="card-link" href={c.href}>{c.link} →</a></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div class="eyebrow">Make legacy systems smarter</div><h2>Don’t replace everything before checking what can be made smart.</h2><p>Existing fire alarm panels, pump controllers and building equipment may provide useful status signals. A site assessment can review outputs, connectivity and practical monitoring options.</p></div><div class="feature-band"><div><h2>Start with the system you already have.</h2><p>Tell us what equipment is installed, what you want to monitor and where the site is located.</p></div><a class="button" href="/contact/">Request a smart-system assessment</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div class="eyebrow">Typical environments</div><h2>Designed around real facility needs.</h2><p>Solutions can be scoped for different facility types and operating priorities.</p></div><div class="pill-row">{['IT / ITES offices','Manufacturing facilities','Commercial buildings','Industrial premises','Server & network rooms','Critical facilities','Office parks','Warehouses'].map(x=><span class="pill">{x}</span>)}</div></div></section>
</MainLayout>
